    title: "javascript: author module_completeness for the node-builtin working set (13 modules: process, fs, url, crypto, path, readline, http, fs/promises, stream/promises, zlib, timers/promises ...) -- the second leg of WI-lutuh's rust -> javascript -> python order"  # 1404
